          {
            "uuid": "479e6b04-4363-5bde-9cfb-e19c372b923a",
            "title": "au-2 determination",
            "description": "Examined the event list agreed with the Installation CSSP on 2026-05-20 and the DT-2 results, and interviewed the ISSO: sign-in, account change, configuration change and update installation events reached the CSSP SIEM within one minute on 12 of 12 units, and the database privileged-activity audit rule (STG-003) was not a finding in the 2026-09-30 scan. The event types are identified, coordinated with the CSSP and logged as the SSP states. Events from the shared fieldtech account name the account rather than a person; that weakness is recorded under ac-2 (FND-001).",
