          {
            "uuid": "0cf769e0-972c-5614-9e1c-a18b3f760998",
            "title": "cm-6 determination",
            "description": "Witnessed the 2026-09-30 SRG/STIG configuration scan of all 12 units and interviewed the ISSO: the approved baseline was in place on every unit with only the configuration-control-board-approved deviations listed in the STIG summary, the web server TLS rule (STG-002) was not a finding, and the nightly configuration check reported no drift during August and September 2026.",
