          {
            "uuid": "ced05998-297a-5336-a4d5-6d0a33af7df6",
            "title": "sc-7 determination",
            "description": "DT-2 port scans from the installation network and from the maintenance port found only the documented ports answering and no routing between the ports, and the witnessed 2026-09-30 scan found the approved signed image, including the deny-by-default host firewall rule set, on 12 of 12 units (SC-07a external and internal interfaces monitored and controlled). ESG has no publicly accessible components (SC-07b). External connections pass only through the Installation Network Enclave edge, whose firewall, intrusion detection and network access control are covered by its ATO of 2025-11-20 (SC-07c). No open STIG finding maps to sc-7.",
