            "title": "Unattributable privileged on-site actions through the shared fieldtech account",
            "description": "An insider or contractor (TE-1) misuses the shared local account fieldtech on the maintenance port; because ten technicians share it and its password is not changed on departure, privileged actions on a gateway cannot be tied to a person, weakening accountability and deterrence.",
