          {
            "uuid": "21683a23-c247-5291-a4c8-8fc5944c34b3",
            "title": "Security-relevant updates are not installed within 30 days on fielded units",
            "description": "SI-2 c. requires security-relevant software and firmware updates to be installed within 30 days of release of the update bundle. Fielded units receive bundles only at quarterly site visits; at the 2026-09-30 scan 2 of 12 units (esg-north-01, esg-ridge-01) ran a 63-day-old bundle with 4 high and 9 medium vulnerabilities that later bundles fix, and STIG finding STG-001 is open. Release 2.2 (planned 2026-12) adds remote update over the uplink.",
